WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.720
Speaker 1: One of the questions that is&nbsp;
increasingly being asked about the legal defense&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:13.020
