00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:06.000
agents and others who said, Sorry, Cassidy,&nbsp;
Hutchinson, not Christina, Bob Cassidy. Hutchinson&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:12.780
is lying to come in and make those claims under&nbsp;
oath, and they never did. And often a strategy is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

